         h - Hunt for food
         E - Enter/Exit a ship
         R - Show player record
         O - Options
         { - Save weapon set
         [ - Recall weapon set
         } - Save gear set
         ] - Recall gear set
         ? - List commands

     Dungeon Commands
     ================
         8 - Move up
         2 - Move down
         4 - Move left
         6 - Move Right
